    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1858">

                <pb facs="1221" n="1105" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg1105"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 701.3111/40.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Venezuelan Chargé
                        d’Affaires.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-06-26">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 26, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I am shocked and grieved to learn of the lamentable death of Senor Rojas and I
                    hasten to extend to you an expression of my profound sympathy.</p>
                <p>The Department would like to consult with you with a view to making arrangements
                    for the funeral service, and to affording you every possible assistance.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. J. Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
